# Files that belong in the repo but must NOT be deployed to smartplaycaddie.com.
#
# 2026-09-03 — CLAUDE.md was committed and immediately became fetchable at
# https://smartplaycaddie.com/CLAUDE.md (HTTP 200), publishing internal dev notes and local
# filesystem paths on the public marketing site. I had inferred .md was not served because
# README.md returns 404 — that is Vercel excluding README specifically, not an extension rule.
# An inference from one sample is not a check; the check is curl after deploy.
#
# .vercelignore is the right tool rather than deleting the file or adding a 404 rewrite: the
# file must stay in git so a fresh clone and Cowork both get the orientation it carries, while
# never reaching the deployment at all.
CLAUDE.md

# Untracked local staging duplicate of this very site. Ignored here too, so it can never be
# uploaded as a second copy of the pages if it is ever added to the repo.
site-vercel/
shots2/
smartplaycaddie-site.zip
